<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM second quarter net profit falls.</title>
<headline>KLM second quarter net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second qtr 96/97 to Sept 96.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				     258   vs  302</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (guilders)	    2.80  vs  3.28</p>
<p>    Operating profit			     182   vs  333</p>
<p>    Traffic revenue (billions)		 2.48  vs  2.31</p>
<p>    Other revenue				  346   vs  324</p>
<p>    Total operating revenues (billions)    2.82  vs  2.63</p>
<p>    Total operating expenses (billions)    2.64  vs  2.30</p>
<p>    Net financial charges			 46   vs   42</p>
<p>    Profit on asset sales			  2   vs   24</p>
<p>    Income from Northwest Airlines	   131   vs   39</p>
<p>    Income from other holdings		  34   vs   44</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit				 303   vs  398</p>
<p>    Tax						 45   vs   95</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
